=======
OPENAI_API_KEY=your-gemini-key-here
>>>>>>> 4f6214c43aea95f5b6a6a45552e4600d4a8d7872
LLM_MODEL=gemini-3.7-flash
# If that model id 404s, the free tier may not carry it yet. Fallbacks,
# newest first: gemini-3.6-flash, gemini-3.5-flash, gemini-2.5-flash
# Live list: https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/models

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION 2 — Groq.  Free, no credit card. Very fast.
# Verified free limits: 30 req/min, 1000 req/day, 8K tokens/min, 200K tokens/day.
# The tokens/day cap is the binding one — see README for how to live within it.
# Get a key at: https://console.groq.com/keys
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LLM_PROVIDER=openai
# LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.groq.com/openai/v1
# OPENAI_API_KEY=gsk_your-key-here
# LLM_MODEL=openai/gpt-oss-120b

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION 3 — Ollama, running on your own laptop. Free forever, no key, no
# quota, works offline. Weaker at writing code, but a genuinely strong story
# for the Feasibility criterion ("zero API spend, zero GPU-hours").
#   Download from ollama.com, then:
#   ollama pull qwen2.5-coder:7b
#   ollama serve
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LLM_PROVIDER=openai
# LLM_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1
# OPENAI_API_KEY=ollama
# LLM_MODEL=qwen2.5-coder:7b

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION 4 — BytePlus ModelArk / Trae, if the organisers require or provide it.
# The problem statement mentions a 7-day free trial for Trae. Ask at the
# webinar whether they are handing out credits — hackathons usually do.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LLM_PROVIDER=openai
# LLM_BASE_URL=<endpoint from their docs>
# OPENAI_API_KEY=<key they give you>
# LLM_MODEL=<model id from their docs>

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION 5 — Paid, only if someone decides to. Not required.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LLM_PROVIDER=anthropic
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
